Binding: create_psychdsish_project
Title: psych-DS-ish Project
Subtitle: Create a research project following the psych-DS-ish standard
Caption: Create a psych-DS-ish research project
Icon: psychdsish.png
OpenFiles: README.md, code/processing.qmd, code/analysis.qmd

Parameter: quarto_yml
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Create _quarto.yml to render processing then analysis in order
Default: On
Position: left

Parameter: studies
Widget: TextInput
Label: Number of studies
Default: 1
Position: right

Parameter: layout
Widget: SelectInput
Label: Multi-study layout (if more than 1 study)
Fields: by_study, by_type
Default: by_study
Position: right
